register.description:
- not used
 - '0' SW PFD_RESET2; '1' synth_dig dual PFD reset  
 - '0' SW PFD_RESET; '1' synth_dig PFD reset  
 - '0' No UP Delay; '1' extra UP delay based on 
 '00' one pres45 clk delay for UP; 
 '01' - 1.5 pres45 clk delay for UP; 
 '10' 2 pres45 clk delay for UP; 
 '11' - 2.5 pres45 clk delay for UP;
 - '0' No DN Delay; '1' extra DN delay based on 
 '00' one pres45 clk delay for DN; 
 '01' - 1.5 pres45 clk delay for DN; 
 '10' 2 pres45 clk delay for DN; 
 '11' - 2.5 pres45 clk delay for DN;

